========================================================

All procedural systems must support an Infinite Parameter Matrix style architecture.

Core laws:

1. Seed-Locked Consistency

Every procedural parameter, noise offset, generation rule, and seed modifier must derive deterministically from the master world seed, realm ID, regional coordinate hash, biome profile, or parent ecosystem record.

Returning to the same coordinate or saved state must reproduce the same generated result unless a persisted world event has changed it.

2. Open-Ended Extensibility

Systems must support runtime injection of new:

